  m_Name: Lego
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LetterData
  contentList:
  - I hope Mrs. Claus and the elves are doing well!  I need new building bricks to
    create my dream house in my bedroom. Could you bring a bunch of them? Thank you!
  - "I hope you are having a great day at the North Pole!  I\u2019m hoping for tiny
    colorful stones that stack into anything I imagine."
